<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Clariant shares.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Clariant shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Clariant registered shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    600 CHF		   PREMIUM	9.85 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.70 CHF		  GEARING	12.53 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  589 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
